8
00:02:44,199 --> 00:02:45,000
But...

9
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:46,000
Madam Cheng...

10
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:46,319
is...

11
00:02:46,599 --> 00:02:48,719
It's exactly for the old lady's sake.

12
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:52,240
She just passed out from the shock.

13
00:02:53,599 --> 00:02:55,199
She can't handle another shock.

14
00:02:57,680 --> 00:03:00,120
I'll find the right time to tell her.

15
00:03:02,439 --> 00:03:03,280
All right then.

16
00:03:03,439 --> 00:03:04,599
Please get some rest.

17
00:03:04,719 --> 00:03:06,039
Let us know if you need anything.

18
00:03:30,919 --> 00:03:32,000
I, Cheng Yan,

19
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:34,000
on behalf of Valley Breeze Group,

20
00:03:34,599 --> 00:03:36,520
offer the victims of this incident

21
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:39,840
and all consumers who trust Valley Breeze Group

22
00:03:40,879 --> 00:03:42,560
our most sincere apologies.

23
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:46,639
Valley Breeze Group has recalled all the defective products

24
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:48,000
and promises

25
00:03:48,639 --> 00:03:49,560
to provide

26
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:51,120
the victims of this incident

27
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:53,159
with ten times the compensation.

28
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:55,039
Valley Breeze Group has already

29
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:57,360
taken the supplier of the syrup products

30
00:03:57,599 --> 00:03:59,280
to court.

31
00:03:59,759 --> 00:04:01,120
As for the departments

32
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:02,560
and personnel involved,

33
00:04:02,719 --> 00:04:04,560
they have been dismissed as punishment.

34
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:05,759
Finally,

35
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:07,759
I hope every consumer

36
00:04:08,159 --> 00:04:10,479
and every friend who supports Valley Breeze

37
00:04:11,319 --> 00:04:12,479
will provide us with

38
00:04:12,599 --> 00:04:13,879
the strictest supervision,

39
00:04:14,039 --> 00:04:16,040
urging Valley Breeze Group

40
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:17,160
to grow bigger

41
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:18,399
and stronger.

42
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:25,639
Congratulations.

43
00:04:26,079 --> 00:04:27,360
Congratulations, Director Sang,

44
00:04:27,439 --> 00:04:28,519
on your promotion.

45
00:04:28,759 --> 00:04:29,639
Same to you.

46
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:31,360
Second Uncle, your reputation has completely turned around.

47
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:32,160
Right now, everyone online

48
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:33,560
is sympathizing with Valley Breeze.

49
00:04:33,959 --> 00:04:35,120
That's only because

50
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:37,399
my little niece gave such great advice.

51
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:39,639
That's how Valley Breeze averted disaster

52
00:04:39,639 --> 00:04:41,000
and turned things around.

53
00:04:41,160 --> 00:04:41,879
Tell me,

54
00:04:41,879 --> 00:04:43,279
what do you want? Just ask Second Uncle.

55
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:44,879
Even if you want the stars in the sky,

56
00:04:44,879 --> 00:04:46,160
I'll pluck them for you.

57
00:04:46,199 --> 00:04:47,759
I can't take any credit.

58
00:04:47,959 --> 00:04:50,079
It's all thanks to Second Uncle's great leadership.

59
00:04:50,759 --> 00:04:52,120
Since we'll be in the same company from now on,

60
00:04:52,199 --> 00:04:53,040
I hope Second Uncle

61
00:04:53,279 --> 00:04:54,319
will look out for me.

62
00:04:54,879 --> 00:04:55,680
Don't worry.

63
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:57,319
From now on, at Valley Breeze,

64
00:04:58,600 --> 00:04:59,800
Second Uncle has your back.

65
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:02,160
I'll take my leave now,

66
00:05:02,439 --> 00:05:03,480
Director Sang.

67
00:05:04,319 --> 00:05:05,480
See you around,

68
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:06,680
successor.

69
00:05:18,519 --> 00:05:19,560
You've moved up fast.

70
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:20,319
Director Sang.

71
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:27,439
Little Uncle, are you questioning

72
00:05:27,439 --> 00:05:29,079
the company's promotion system?

73
00:05:29,079 --> 00:05:30,000
I'm not questioning it,

74
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,160
because

75
00:05:31,879 --> 00:05:33,240
I'm the one who made the rules.

76
00:05:33,360 --> 00:05:34,160
However,

77
00:05:34,279 --> 00:05:35,680
I'd like to remind you of one thing.

78
00:05:35,759 --> 00:05:36,879
This position

79
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:38,759
is easy to get, but hard to keep.

80
00:05:40,160 --> 00:05:41,199
So I hope you

81
00:05:41,759 --> 00:05:43,439
last longer than your predecessor.

82
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:47,800
Thanks for your concern, Little Uncle.

83
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:50,759
But this position,

84
00:05:53,160 --> 00:05:54,600
I really won't be in it for long.

85
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:57,439
Because I have my eyes on a better seat.

86
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:59,920
It seems Director Sang has her eyes on my position.

87
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:02,639
Not really.

88
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:04,920
Better than yours.

89
00:06:10,639 --> 00:06:12,000
I'd really like to see

90
00:06:12,759 --> 00:06:15,120
