91
00:06:18,399 --> 00:06:19,800
Why did you, on your very first day,

92
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:21,399
print this purchase order?

93
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:23,319
And how did it just so happen

94
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:24,839
that Cheng Ruolin saw it?

95
00:06:25,519 --> 00:06:26,480
And even more coincidentally,

96
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:29,240
the warehouse security footage that day was gone.

97
00:06:30,319 --> 00:06:32,120
With so many coincidences combined,

98
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:35,040
it's no longer a coincidence.

99
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:37,959
If you're using the same

100
00:06:37,959 --> 00:06:39,079
cheap tricks you used on Cheng Ruolin,

101
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:40,839
I won't be impressed.

102
00:06:42,879 --> 00:06:43,600
Little Uncle,

103
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:45,600
