104
00:06:45,879 --> 00:06:48,439
To think you even know about such trivial things.

105
00:06:48,959 --> 00:06:49,759
Sang Luo,

106
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:51,600
no matter what you're scheming,

107
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:54,240
if you dare to harm Valley Breeze,

108
00:06:54,639 --> 00:06:55,920
then don't blame me for what happens.

109
00:07:02,079 --> 00:07:04,879
What kind of schemes could a little girl like me have?

110
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:08,360
But your "don't blame me," Little Uncle,

111
00:07:09,199 --> 00:07:10,680
makes me kind of look forward to it.

112
00:07:28,720 --> 00:07:30,519
Is your head feeling any better?

113
00:07:31,519 --> 00:07:33,160
Does it hurt anywhere else?

114
00:07:37,079 --> 00:07:38,720
Fuck.

115
00:07:41,839 --> 00:07:43,879
You fell from the second floor on purpose, didn't you?

116
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:57,480
Let's go down.

117
00:07:57,639 --> 00:07:58,560
Help!

118
00:07:58,920 --> 00:07:59,920
Help!

119
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:02,959
Was it just to send Cheng Ruolin to prison?

120
00:08:04,199 --> 00:08:06,079
This isn't the first time she's treated you like this.

121
00:08:07,079 --> 00:08:08,680
Why did you do this all of a sudden?

122
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:16,439
It's okay.

123
00:08:16,879 --> 00:08:18,160
If you don't want to tell me, forget it.

124
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:20,600
I'll keep your secret.

125
00:08:22,279 --> 00:08:23,199
When necessary,

126
00:08:24,360 --> 00:08:25,560
I certainly have the courage.

127
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:28,600
Whether it's to protect myself,

128
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:32,240
or to protect my friends.

129
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:35,720
At any time,

130
00:08:35,919 --> 00:08:37,320
you need to have courage.

131
00:08:37,519 --> 00:08:38,919
Whether it's to defend yourself,

132
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:40,399
or to defend your friends.

133
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:45,600
Letting my mom leave

134
00:08:47,519 --> 00:08:49,039
is also the best choice for the Cheng family.

135
00:09:34,120 --> 00:09:34,960
Spinach,

136
00:09:35,519 --> 00:09:37,200
oats, and similar foods are rich in

137
00:09:38,320 --> 00:09:39,639
natural folic acid.

138
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:43,720
Watch out for gestational diabetes.

139
00:09:44,399 --> 00:09:45,879
Monitor your levels

140
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:48,000
five times a day.

141
00:09:48,879 --> 00:09:49,679
Yucheng.

142
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:52,120
Wanmei.

143
00:09:52,399 --> 00:09:53,279
What are you doing here?

144
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:05,080
Wanmei, what's wrong?

145
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:05,919
Are you not feeling well?

146
00:10:07,279 --> 00:10:08,080
What happened?

147
00:10:09,759 --> 00:10:10,879
The baby is gone.

148
00:10:15,679 --> 00:10:16,480
Wanmei.

149
00:10:17,919 --> 00:10:18,720
It's okay.

150
00:10:19,759 --> 00:10:20,600
It's okay.

151
00:10:20,799 --> 00:10:21,600
Wanmei.

152
00:10:21,919 --> 00:10:22,879
We're still young.

153
00:10:23,399 --> 00:10:24,720
We can have another one.

154
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:28,720
They killed the baby you and I have been longing for.

155
00:10:30,159 --> 00:10:31,480
I won't let this go.

156
00:10:51,159 --> 00:10:52,559
Cheng Ruolin owes so much money

157
00:10:52,799 --> 00:10:54,080
just for this trash.

158
00:10:54,639 --> 00:10:55,960
That stupid woman.

159
00:10:56,039 --> 00:10:57,720
She saw the high return rate and jumped right in.

160
00:10:58,399 --> 00:10:59,559
She might be stupid,

161
00:10:59,799 --> 00:11:01,200
but she's not that stupid.

162
00:11:02,279 --> 00:11:03,679
So you're saying...

163
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:05,399
someone deliberately set her up?

164
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:14,840
In the future, clients with more money than sense...

165
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:15,559
keep sending them my way.

166
00:11:23,799 --> 00:11:24,519
That's a lot.

167
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:35,559
Making money, huh?

168
00:11:35,799 --> 00:11:36,679
Yeah.

169
00:11:37,559 --> 00:11:40,000
Since I can't work at the company and get paid,

170
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:41,279
can't I make some money on my own?

171
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:46,639
Can you help me look into

172
00:11:46,639 --> 00:11:48,720
Sang Luo's dealings with this Manager Wei?

173
00:11:49,759 --> 00:11:52,480
You suspect Sang Luo set a trap for Cheng Ruolin?

174
00:11:52,759 --> 00:11:54,120
I originally thought

175
00:11:54,120 --> 00:11:56,559
she joined the Cheng family just for a share of the fortune.

176
00:11:57,639 --> 00:11:58,840
But now it seems

177
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:02,240
things aren't that simple.

178
00:12:06,879 --> 00:12:08,200
I've been waiting a long time for you,

179
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:10,799
Wanmei.

180
00:12:23,960 --> 00:12:25,279
Let's go grab a drink.

181
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:38,519
Come,

182
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:40,519
let's celebrate

183
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:41,919
our successful partnership.

184
00:12:45,960 --> 00:12:46,759
I forgot.

185
00:12:46,759 --> 00:12:48,720
Auntie can't drink while pregnant.

186
00:12:49,559 --> 00:12:51,120
Then I'll down this for Auntie.

187
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:52,679
Here's to our

188
00:12:52,840 --> 00:12:54,200
continued close cooperation.

189
00:13:04,120 --> 00:13:05,159
The doctor said

190
00:13:05,399 --> 00:13:06,960
moderate drinking is fine during pregnancy.

191
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:07,799
As it happens,

192
00:13:07,879 --> 00:13:08,960
I'd like a drink too.

193
00:13:12,320 --> 00:13:13,879
I prepared this especially for you.

194
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:14,759
Try it.

195
00:13:28,039 --> 00:13:29,120
Kista's wine.

196
00:13:30,879 --> 00:13:33,039
Your sense of smell is as sharp as ever, Auntie.

197
00:13:33,919 --> 00:13:35,679
This wine is called Avaritia.

198
00:13:36,759 --> 00:13:39,879
Though it's not Kista's masterpiece,

199
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:42,039
she still poured her heart into it.

200
00:13:42,440 --> 00:13:44,080
Kista has a true masterpiece

201
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:46,279
called Invidia.

202
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:48,840
There is only one bottle on the market right now.

203
00:13:49,159 --> 00:13:50,159
And I have it.

204
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:51,960
With something so good,

205
00:13:52,879 --> 00:13:54,279
why keep it hidden away?

206
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:55,600
No matter how good the wine is,

207
00:13:55,679 --> 00:13:57,440
it still needs the right moment.

208
00:13:58,279 --> 00:14:00,279
When I open this bottle of Invidia,

209
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:02,480
I'll definitely invite you, Auntie.

210
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:06,200
I'm looking forward to it.

211
00:14:10,440 --> 00:14:12,519
I heard Song Qingfeng's daughter, Song Yun,

212
00:14:12,799 --> 00:14:14,320
is returning here to choose a husband.

213
00:14:14,840 --> 00:14:16,039
Our President Yan

214
00:14:16,399 --> 00:14:18,240
is also interested in marrying this Song Yun.

215
00:14:18,519 --> 00:14:19,279
Cheng Yan?

216
00:14:19,320 --> 00:14:19,759
Yeah.

217
00:14:20,399 --> 00:14:22,360
Doesn't he fool around with starlets all day?

218
00:14:23,120 --> 00:14:24,159
What does that matter?

219
00:14:24,639 --> 00:14:27,080
Whoever marries the heiress of Anxin Group

220
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:30,399
will wield immense power in the business world.

221
00:14:30,399 --> 00:14:31,960
Who wouldn't want to fight for it?

222
00:14:34,440 --> 00:14:35,240
President An,

223
00:14:35,759 --> 00:14:38,519
you absolutely can't let Cheng Yan beat you to it.

224
00:14:43,320 --> 00:14:44,840
You want me and Cheng Yan

225
00:14:44,879 --> 00:14:46,039
to fight over a woman?

226
00:14:47,039 --> 00:14:47,759
President An,

227
00:14:47,919 --> 00:14:49,360
in order to vote for you,

228
00:14:49,360 --> 00:14:51,679
we've sacrificed a lot of our own interests.

229
00:14:51,840 --> 00:14:54,120
Only when you take the chairman's seat

230
00:14:54,120 --> 00:14:55,279
and take control of Valley Breeze Group,

231
00:14:55,360 --> 00:14:56,559
will our investments

232
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:58,320
not go down the drain.

233
00:15:08,960 --> 00:15:09,960
I'll think about it.

234
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:13,200
Then we'll

235
00:15:13,360 --> 00:15:14,679
look forward to

236
00:15:14,679 --> 00:15:16,120
your wedding toast, Young Master An!

237
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:31,759
That niece of yours is really something.

238
00:15:32,039 --> 00:15:34,200
I'm afraid you've really met your match this time.

239
00:15:46,759 --> 00:15:47,440
What is it?

240
00:15:47,720 --> 00:15:49,720
How many times have you been to Manager Wei's investment company?

241
00:15:55,159 --> 00:15:56,960
What do you mean by that, Little Uncle?

242
00:15:57,679 --> 00:15:59,000
You deliberately had Manager Wei

243
00:15:59,480 --> 00:16:00,559
lead Cheng Ruolin

244
00:16:00,559 --> 00:16:02,039
to invest in those bad real estate projects.

245
00:16:02,679 --> 00:16:04,759
Exploiting Cheng Ruolin's trust in Manager Wei,

246
00:16:04,879 --> 00:16:06,240
you crippled her capital chain.

247
00:16:06,960 --> 00:16:08,320
From the very beginning,

248
00:16:08,679 --> 00:16:09,559
these projects were traps,

249
00:16:10,039 --> 00:16:10,799
weren't they?

250
00:16:13,679 --> 00:16:15,559
What a touching sibling bond.

251
00:16:16,519 --> 00:16:17,960
Is Little Uncle here to

252
00:16:17,960 --> 00:16:19,360
stand up for Cheng Ruolin?

253
00:16:20,759 --> 00:16:22,759
I didn't see you care about her before.

254
00:16:23,240 --> 00:16:25,440
Why play the white knight now?

255
00:16:26,039 --> 00:16:27,559
I originally thought you came back

256
00:16:28,320 --> 00:16:29,559
to start over.

257
00:16:29,759 --> 00:16:31,559
But you've been secretly setting traps.

258
00:16:32,360 --> 00:16:33,480
I warned you.

259
00:16:33,720 --> 00:16:35,360
If you dare harm the Cheng family,

260
00:16:35,399 --> 00:16:36,679
I won't let you get away with it.

261
00:16:39,200 --> 00:16:40,720
You won't let me get away with it?

262
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:47,360
If Little Uncle is truly so righteous,

263
00:16:48,360 --> 00:16:50,480
why didn't you stand up for Xie Dongdong,

264
00:16:50,480 --> 00:16:51,879
who was bullied every day?

265
00:16:52,200 --> 00:16:55,080
Why didn't you stand up for me when I was bullied?

266
00:16:55,679 --> 00:16:58,000
Aside from your own interests,

267
00:16:58,519 --> 00:17:00,159
do you Cheng family members care if others live or die?

268
00:17:00,679 --> 00:17:02,360
What right do you have to judge me?

269
00:17:05,720 --> 00:17:06,519
This.

270
00:17:10,960 --> 00:17:12,160
And this.

271
00:17:13,160 --> 00:17:15,400
It's all thanks to you Cheng family members.

272
00:17:16,240 --> 00:17:18,039
If you had even a shred of conscience,

273
00:17:18,480 --> 00:17:19,599
would I have been unable to afford treatment,

274
00:17:20,519 --> 00:17:21,799
ended up permanently disabled,

275
00:17:21,799 --> 00:17:23,279
and barely escaped with my life?

276
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:25,920
You owe me for all of this!

277
00:17:26,559 --> 00:17:28,160
"Start over," you say?

278
00:17:29,759 --> 00:17:31,880
What right do you have to say that to me?

279
00:17:40,359 --> 00:17:42,119
We're going to harvest

280
00:17:42,119 --> 00:17:44,119
all of her usable organs to sell.

281
00:17:44,759 --> 00:17:47,319
We're going to make a fortune this time.

282
00:17:49,240 --> 00:17:50,680
Don't celebrate just yet.

283
00:17:51,240 --> 00:17:56,039
