284
00:17:56,119 --> 00:17:56,920
Calm down.

285
00:17:56,960 --> 00:17:57,920
Don't move.

286
00:17:59,519 --> 00:17:59,839
Here.

287
00:17:59,960 --> 00:18:00,319
Hurry.

288
00:18:01,640 --> 00:18:02,200
Hurry!

289
00:18:02,519 --> 00:18:03,079
Over here.

290
00:18:06,119 --> 00:18:06,680
Open the door!

291
00:18:07,359 --> 00:18:07,920
Open the door!

292
00:18:29,039 --> 00:18:29,839
Are you okay?

293
00:19:11,640 --> 00:19:14,279
Every red wine has a soul.

294
00:19:14,559 --> 00:19:15,400
Before you drink it,

295
00:19:15,559 --> 00:19:17,079
you have to let it know,

296
00:19:17,640 --> 00:19:19,000
"I'm going to drink you."

297
00:19:19,720 --> 00:19:21,319
"I'm going to drink you."

298
00:19:23,039 --> 00:19:24,319
And you need to swirl it.

299
00:19:27,359 --> 00:19:28,400
That gesture of yours...

300
00:19:28,960 --> 00:19:29,759
What about it?

301
00:19:30,559 --> 00:19:31,920
reminds me of someone.

302
00:19:49,519 --> 00:19:52,240
If Little Uncle wants to complain to Grandma, be my guest.

303
00:19:53,240 --> 00:19:54,759
I'm off the clock now. I'm leaving.

304
00:19:55,880 --> 00:19:57,039
I still have to play

305
00:19:57,119 --> 00:19:58,640
the dutiful grandchild

306
00:19:59,440 --> 00:20:00,640
and pick Grandma up from the hospital.

307
00:20:01,400 --> 00:20:03,839
After all, not everyone is like Little Uncle,

308
00:20:04,599 --> 00:20:06,720
born with everything.

309
00:20:11,480 --> 00:20:12,279
I'll give you a ride.

310
00:20:25,640 --> 00:20:27,640
This No. 106 Cabernet Sauvignon

311
00:20:27,799 --> 00:20:29,720
was produced in October 2021.

312
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:31,279
In mid-2022,

313
00:20:31,279 --> 00:20:33,519
we completed sealing the first batch.

314
00:20:34,119 --> 00:20:35,799
Who was the original winemaker for this wine?

315
00:20:35,799 --> 00:20:36,559
It was me.

316
00:20:37,240 --> 00:20:38,440
I'm sorry, President Lin.

317
00:20:38,559 --> 00:20:39,440
What I made

318
00:20:39,519 --> 00:20:40,799
wasn't good enough.

319
00:20:41,799 --> 00:20:43,200
The green notes are too heavy,

320
00:20:43,200 --> 00:20:44,400
affecting the taste.

321
00:20:45,440 --> 00:20:46,240
However,

322
00:20:48,160 --> 00:20:49,960
it's already the best one here.

323
00:20:51,160 --> 00:20:52,559
Where did you source the grapes?

324
00:20:52,839 --> 00:20:54,880
I chose a region with sufficient sunlight

325
00:20:55,079 --> 00:20:56,839
that is also cool,

326
00:20:57,359 --> 00:20:59,519
to create a personalized brand distinct

327
00:20:59,559 --> 00:21:01,240
from common Cabernet Sauvignons on the market,

328
00:21:01,960 --> 00:21:03,279
to attract a younger audience.

329
00:21:04,640 --> 00:21:05,519
Wanmei,

330
00:21:05,759 --> 00:21:07,119
Only by building a personalized

331
00:21:07,119 --> 00:21:08,200
and differentiated brand

332
00:21:08,240 --> 00:21:10,680
can Valley Breeze's wine attract young people.

333
00:21:10,720 --> 00:21:12,640
They're the main driving force of mass consumption.

334
00:21:13,839 --> 00:21:15,319
How long have you been with the company?

335
00:21:16,200 --> 00:21:17,240
Four years

336
00:21:17,319 --> 00:21:18,480
and two months.

337
00:21:19,359 --> 00:21:20,960
When you first joined the company,

338
00:21:21,119 --> 00:21:22,279
who trained you?

339
00:21:25,640 --> 00:21:26,440
It...

340
00:21:27,599 --> 00:21:28,720
It was Xiaowei.

341
00:21:29,279 --> 00:21:30,240
Good concept.

342
00:21:30,799 --> 00:21:31,960
As long as you work hard,

343
00:21:32,359 --> 00:21:34,319
surpassing everyone in the R&D department

344
00:21:34,680 --> 00:21:35,759
is just around the corner.

345
00:21:45,640 --> 00:21:46,279
Mom.

346
00:21:47,079 --> 00:21:48,200
Is that comfortable?

347
00:21:48,200 --> 00:21:48,839
Mhm.

348
00:21:49,839 --> 00:21:51,160
Are you relaxed?

349
00:21:54,039 --> 00:21:54,799
You...

350
00:21:55,200 --> 00:21:56,960
Just say what's on your mind.

351
00:21:57,039 --> 00:21:58,680
Don't I know you?

352
00:21:58,920 --> 00:22:00,240
You wouldn't visit for nothing,

353
00:22:00,240 --> 00:22:01,400
you must be up to something.

354
00:22:02,400 --> 00:22:03,079
Mom,

355
00:22:03,200 --> 00:22:04,759
I knew I couldn't hide anything

356
00:22:04,759 --> 00:22:06,640
from the Queen Mother's piercing eyes.

357
00:22:07,839 --> 00:22:08,640
Um,

358
00:22:09,200 --> 00:22:10,720
since my sister is sick,

359
00:22:11,039 --> 00:22:13,119
I was thinking about her shares...

360
00:22:13,960 --> 00:22:15,960
I could hold them for her.

361
00:22:16,799 --> 00:22:18,200
Those are left for Dongdong.

362
00:22:18,359 --> 00:22:19,880
Don't even think about it.

363
00:22:21,640 --> 00:22:22,440
Are you off work?

364
00:22:25,400 --> 00:22:27,680
I'm telling you, you short-sighted fool.

365
00:22:28,039 --> 00:22:30,240
Your most urgent priority right now,

366
00:22:30,319 --> 00:22:33,079
is to secure the marriage with the Song family.

367
00:22:33,440 --> 00:22:35,240
What the Song family can give you

368
00:22:35,240 --> 00:22:37,680
is far more important than those shares.

369
00:22:38,160 --> 00:22:39,519
It's your own fault for being a disappointment,

370
00:22:39,759 --> 00:22:41,960
falling short of Cheng An in every way.

371
00:22:42,960 --> 00:22:43,759
Mom!

372
00:22:44,039 --> 00:22:44,960
If others said this,

373
00:22:44,960 --> 00:22:45,839
I would just let it go.

374
00:22:45,839 --> 00:22:46,839
But you're saying this too!

375
00:22:47,039 --> 00:22:47,440
You...

376
00:22:47,440 --> 00:22:48,039
If that's what you think,

377
00:22:48,039 --> 00:22:48,559
then you...

378
00:22:48,559 --> 00:22:49,799
then go ask him to be the chairman!

379
00:22:50,400 --> 00:22:51,200
Look at you.

380
00:22:51,559 --> 00:22:52,720
You're either with some minor star,

381
00:22:52,720 --> 00:22:53,799
or a little internet celebrity.

382
00:22:53,960 --> 00:22:54,480
I...

383
00:22:54,519 --> 00:22:56,599
Once Cheng An truly takes control of the company,

384
00:22:57,000 --> 00:22:59,119
it'll be too late for you to regret it.

385
00:23:02,200 --> 00:23:03,119
Little Uncle,

386
00:23:04,279 --> 00:23:06,559
don't tell me you're relying on a woman to seize power too.

387
00:23:11,039 --> 00:23:11,720
Mom...

388
00:23:14,559 --> 00:23:15,359
Grandma.

389
00:23:15,960 --> 00:23:16,920
Luo Luo is here.

390
00:23:22,559 --> 00:23:24,000
How is Grandma's recovery going?

391
00:23:24,720 --> 00:23:26,200
Just now at the door,

392
00:23:26,200 --> 00:23:28,720
I heard you and Second Uncle talking about something.

393
00:23:28,720 --> 00:23:29,359
What was it?

394
00:23:29,359 --> 00:23:30,279
It sounded so lively.

395
00:23:31,039 --> 00:23:32,440
I was discussing with your grandma

396
00:23:33,279 --> 00:23:34,640
who is qualified

397
00:23:34,759 --> 00:23:36,599
to be the chairman of Valley Breeze.

398
00:23:37,599 --> 00:23:38,440
Mom, drink some water.

399
00:23:50,240 --> 00:23:51,279
I heard

400
00:23:52,160 --> 00:23:54,319
the company has many shareholders

401
00:23:54,319 --> 00:23:55,440
supporting Little Uncle.

402
00:23:58,559 --> 00:23:59,359
Of course,

403
00:23:59,839 --> 00:24:01,559
Second Uncle has Grandma's support,

404
00:24:02,039 --> 00:24:03,279
so he's not weak either.

405
00:24:03,960 --> 00:24:05,839
They are evenly matched.

406
00:24:06,519 --> 00:24:07,640
This chairman position

407
00:24:08,079 --> 00:24:09,440
is really hard to choose.

408
00:24:09,759 --> 00:24:10,319
Luoluo,

409
00:24:10,319 --> 00:24:11,359
let me tell you,

410
00:24:11,640 --> 00:24:13,119
I don't have any obsession

411
00:24:13,119 --> 00:24:14,440
with being the chairman.

412
00:24:15,039 --> 00:24:16,000
I just want to

413
00:24:16,119 --> 00:24:18,039
share some of your grandma's pressure.

414
00:24:18,079 --> 00:24:19,400
I want to be dutiful to her.

415
00:24:19,480 --> 00:24:21,000
Mostly just to make her happy.

416
00:24:21,000 --> 00:24:22,160
That's the most important.

417
00:24:23,599 --> 00:24:24,400
True.

418
00:24:24,799 --> 00:24:26,160
If you cause less trouble,

419
00:24:26,240 --> 00:24:27,559
Mom will naturally be happy.

420
00:24:27,680 --> 00:24:28,480
Hey,

421
00:24:29,160 --> 00:24:30,559
are you sick in the head?

422
00:24:32,519 --> 00:24:34,119
Who the hell do you think you are?

423
00:24:34,119 --> 00:24:35,599
Bossing me around here!

424
00:24:35,599 --> 00:24:36,400
A big shot?

425
00:24:38,839 --> 00:24:39,279
You...

426
00:24:39,480 --> 00:24:39,920
You...

427
00:24:40,240 --> 00:24:41,920
You are the murderer who killed Dad!

428
00:24:42,240 --> 00:24:43,400
Just mind your own business. That's enough.

429
00:24:43,400 --> 00:24:43,920
Hey, you,

430
00:24:44,440 --> 00:24:45,920
stop going on and on.

431
00:24:48,640 --> 00:24:50,440
Didn't you say you'd pick me up?

432
00:24:50,880 --> 00:24:51,920
Why are you just standing there?

433
00:24:53,720 --> 00:24:54,519
Grandma,

434
00:24:54,880 --> 00:24:55,640
let's go. Move.

435
00:24:55,640 --> 00:24:56,119
Let's go home.

436
00:24:56,119 --> 00:24:56,599
Step aside.

437
00:24:56,920 --> 00:24:57,480
Let's go.

438
00:25:04,960 --> 00:25:06,559
I really am getting old.

439
00:25:06,839 --> 00:25:09,160
My legs hurt after just a few steps.

440
00:25:11,200 --> 00:25:12,160
Where is Wanmei?

441
00:25:12,279 --> 00:25:13,599
Have her fetch me a basin of water

442
00:25:13,680 --> 00:25:14,759
and give my feet a good rub.

443
00:25:15,839 --> 00:25:16,960
Some people

444
00:25:17,039 --> 00:25:19,039
didn't pick you up from the hospital,

445
00:25:19,160 --> 00:25:21,119
and didn't even welcome you home.

446
00:25:21,160 --> 00:25:23,440
Your eldest son is the most considerate!

447
00:25:23,839 --> 00:25:24,920
Outsiders

448
00:25:24,920 --> 00:25:26,400
are outsiders after all.

449
00:25:26,720 --> 00:25:28,920
How can they compare to your own kids?

450
00:25:28,920 --> 00:25:29,839
Exactly!

451
00:25:31,839 --> 00:25:32,640
Mom,

452
00:25:32,720 --> 00:25:33,680
here is the hot water.

453
00:25:37,680 --> 00:25:38,799
So clumsy!

454
00:25:38,799 --> 00:25:39,680
What are you doing?

455
00:25:39,839 --> 00:25:40,720
Goodness.

456
00:25:41,759 --> 00:25:43,240
Look how clumsy I am.

457
00:25:43,519 --> 00:25:45,039
I'll fetch another basin of water for Mom.

458
00:25:45,240 --> 00:25:46,319
Your belly...

459
00:25:46,480 --> 00:25:47,279
What's wrong?

460
00:25:48,160 --> 00:25:49,400
It's nothing serious.

461
00:25:49,839 --> 00:25:50,759
It's just that

462
00:25:50,839 --> 00:25:52,759
the doctor said I have symptoms of a threatened miscarriage.

463
00:25:53,519 --> 00:25:54,720
He told me to rest more.

464
00:25:55,359 --> 00:25:56,960
Why didn't you say so earlier?

465
00:25:58,119 --> 00:25:59,440
I was afraid Mom would misunderstand.

466
00:25:59,680 --> 00:26:01,640
Can't you just tell me straight?

467
00:26:02,440 --> 00:26:03,119
Would I

468
00:26:03,359 --> 00:26:04,319
make things difficult for you?

469
00:26:04,599 --> 00:26:05,279
Exactly.

470
00:26:05,279 --> 00:26:06,000
Sister-in-law,

471
00:26:06,079 --> 00:26:07,640
what were you thinking?

472
00:26:08,319 --> 00:26:09,200
Is Mom the kind of person

473
00:26:09,200 --> 00:26:10,799
who doesn't care about family?

474
00:26:14,359 --> 00:26:15,359
And you, Third Brother.

475
00:26:16,519 --> 00:26:17,640
I have to lecture you a bit.

476
00:26:17,960 --> 00:26:19,160
Even though our oldest brother is gone,

477
00:26:19,519 --> 00:26:21,720
she is still his woman.

478
00:26:22,440 --> 00:26:24,319
You need to watch your behavior.

479
00:26:24,519 --> 00:26:25,839
If outsiders saw you,

480
00:26:25,839 --> 00:26:26,920
they'd say our family lacks morals.

481
00:26:26,920 --> 00:26:27,680
Would that sound good?

482
00:26:28,119 --> 00:26:29,759
I just gave her a hand.

483
00:26:30,599 --> 00:26:31,400
Sure enough,

484
00:26:31,640 --> 00:26:32,440
a filthy person

485
00:26:32,440 --> 00:26:33,839
has a filthy mind.

486
00:26:33,839 --> 00:26:35,440
Hey, what do you mean by that?

487
00:26:35,759 --> 00:26:36,440
Literally what I said.

488
00:26:36,440 --> 00:26:37,519
What's wrong with me lecturing you?

489
00:26:37,640 --> 00:26:38,640
Enough!

490
00:26:39,160 --> 00:26:40,680
If you two are going to fight again,

491
00:26:40,839 --> 00:26:42,720
get the hell out, both of you!

492
00:26:49,559 --> 00:26:50,519
Cheng An.

493
00:26:50,880 --> 00:26:52,759
I had a dream last night.

494
00:26:53,160 --> 00:26:54,440
I dreamed of your father.

495
00:26:55,079 --> 00:26:55,960
Tomorrow,

496
00:26:55,960 --> 00:26:57,960
come with me to visit him.

497
00:26:58,200 --> 00:26:59,000
Mom,

498
00:26:59,599 --> 00:27:00,400
I'm sorry,

499
00:27:00,920 --> 00:27:01,960
I have plans tomorrow.

500
00:27:04,839 --> 00:27:06,039
Have you forgotten

501
00:27:06,240 --> 00:27:07,880
how your father died?

502
00:27:14,359 --> 00:27:15,160
Fine.

503
00:27:16,000 --> 00:27:16,799
I understand.

504
00:27:17,920 --> 00:27:19,400
I'll buy some incense and joss paper tomorrow.

505
00:27:25,559 --> 00:27:26,839
Cheng An,

506
00:27:28,599 --> 00:27:30,359
do you really want to marry Song Yun?

507
00:27:36,440 --> 00:27:37,480
Whatever you want,

508
00:27:38,160 --> 00:27:39,559
I can help you get it too.

509
00:27:46,319 --> 00:27:47,119
Sister-in-law,

510
00:27:47,279 --> 00:27:48,759
if you have so much free time,

511
00:27:49,759 --> 00:27:51,599
you should focus more on your work.

512
00:27:51,759 --> 00:27:52,559
That way,

513
00:27:53,000 --> 00:27:54,200
the internal judges at the wine convention

514
00:27:54,200 --> 00:27:55,680
won't complain about Valley Breeze

515
00:27:56,279 --> 00:27:58,200
not having decent new products in years.

516
00:28:22,759 --> 00:28:24,000
You didn't reply to my text.

517
00:28:24,319 --> 00:28:25,160
What's wrong?

518
00:28:27,119 --> 00:28:28,160
That gesture of yours

519
00:28:28,880 --> 00:28:30,240
reminds me of someone.

520
00:28:30,559 --> 00:28:32,240
I couldn't control my emotions today.

521
00:28:32,559 --> 00:28:34,519
Cheng An almost blew my cover.

522
00:28:34,680 --> 00:28:36,279
He seems to still have feelings for you.

523
00:28:37,039 --> 00:28:37,839
What about you?

524
00:28:38,960 --> 00:28:40,079
Are you over him?

525
00:28:42,400 --> 00:28:43,200
Of course.

526
00:28:43,759 --> 00:28:44,559
A guy like him

527
00:28:44,680 --> 00:28:45,880
is used to putting on an act.

528
00:28:46,480 --> 00:28:48,880
Otherwise, how could he survive in a cesspool like the Cheng family

529
00:28:48,880 --> 00:28:50,279
and climb to the CEO position?

530
00:28:52,720 --> 00:28:54,160
Faking devotion

531
00:28:54,799 --> 00:28:56,880
to ease his own guilt.

532
00:28:58,119 --> 00:28:58,920
Hypocrite.

533
00:28:59,720 --> 00:29:00,559
Don't worry.

534
00:29:01,119 --> 00:29:02,519
I'm going to exploit his hypocrisy

535
00:29:02,519 --> 00:29:03,799
to get what I want.

536
00:29:04,359 --> 00:29:06,200
Since you know the Cheng family is a cesspool,

537
00:29:07,000 --> 00:29:08,119
then you must be extra careful.

538
00:29:09,559 --> 00:29:11,400
Cheng An and Lin Wanmei aren't easy to deal with.

539
00:29:11,599 --> 00:29:11,960
Alright.

540
00:29:11,960 --> 00:29:12,720
I know.

541
00:29:14,039 --> 00:29:14,720
That's it for now.

542
00:29:14,720 --> 00:29:15,480
I'm hanging up.

543
00:30:00,119 --> 00:30:01,240
Cheng An

544
00:30:02,720 --> 00:30:04,079
Do you still remember

545
00:30:04,400 --> 00:30:06,960
your father's teachings before he died?

546
00:30:07,759 --> 00:30:08,680
Of course I remember.

547
00:30:08,839 --> 00:30:09,160
Mother.

548
00:30:10,440 --> 00:30:11,680
Father told me

549
00:30:12,039 --> 00:30:13,200
to be modest and respectful,

550
00:30:13,680 --> 00:30:15,240
and to protect the Cheng family business.

551
00:30:15,680 --> 00:30:16,759
Good that you remember.

552
00:30:17,240 --> 00:30:18,240
Then from now on,

553
00:30:18,640 --> 00:30:20,519
stop coveting things

554
00:30:21,160 --> 00:30:22,960
that don't belong to you.

555
00:30:28,599 --> 00:30:29,359
Mother,

556
00:30:30,400 --> 00:30:31,319
ever since I was little,

557
00:30:31,319 --> 00:30:32,880
I've done everything to please you

558
00:30:34,119 --> 00:30:35,799
just to get a single word of praise.

559
00:30:36,359 --> 00:30:38,559
But all I got in return was ridicule.

560
00:30:39,559 --> 00:30:40,880
Out of us four siblings,

561
00:30:42,039 --> 00:30:43,519
you only treat me this way.

562
00:30:44,119 --> 00:30:45,240
Cheng An,

563
00:30:45,359 --> 00:30:47,240
I've raised you for over thirty years.

564
00:30:47,240 --> 00:30:49,240
If it weren't for those thirty years,

565
00:30:51,200 --> 00:30:52,759
I'd think you were my enemy.

566
00:31:06,240 --> 00:31:07,359
You came to me

567
00:31:08,440 --> 00:31:10,000
just to pay off your debt.

568
00:31:10,640 --> 00:31:12,880
Even if you slave away your whole life,

569
00:31:14,519 --> 00:31:15,799
you could never repay it.

570
00:31:29,359 --> 00:31:30,599
An.

571
00:31:31,039 --> 00:31:32,839
I want to sleep for a while.

572
00:31:32,839 --> 00:31:35,200
Go play outside by yourself.

573
00:31:35,640 --> 00:31:36,359
Okay.

574
00:31:57,839 --> 00:31:58,640
What's up, Mom?

575
00:31:59,119 --> 00:31:59,680
Need something?

576
00:31:59,680 --> 00:32:00,440
Sit down.

577
00:32:02,839 --> 00:32:04,079
Tell me what it is.

578
00:32:04,160 --> 00:32:05,119
I'm busy.

579
00:32:06,240 --> 00:32:07,079
Busy with what?

580
00:32:07,319 --> 00:32:08,920
Busy hooking up with women?

581
00:32:14,119 --> 00:32:15,920
What kind of talk is that?

582
00:32:16,359 --> 00:32:17,480
Play around all you want,

583
00:32:17,720 --> 00:32:18,599
I don't care.

584
00:32:19,039 --> 00:32:19,799
But

585
00:32:19,799 --> 00:32:21,519
don't do it in public.

586
00:32:21,920 --> 00:32:22,839
Your marriage

587
00:32:23,000 --> 00:32:25,559
must be an asset to inherit Valley Breeze.

588
00:32:25,799 --> 00:32:26,680
Song Yun

589
00:32:26,799 --> 00:32:28,119
might be a bit dominant,

590
00:32:28,400 --> 00:32:29,200
but

591
00:32:29,519 --> 00:32:31,680
if you want to inherit Valley Breeze...

592
00:32:34,839 --> 00:32:35,640
I get it.

593
00:32:36,359 --> 00:32:37,440
If there's a shortcut,

594
00:32:37,519 --> 00:32:38,839
who wouldn't take it?

595
00:32:39,480 --> 00:32:40,319
Don't worry.

596
00:32:40,960 --> 00:32:43,079
For the sake of Valley Breeze's growth,

597
00:32:44,079 --> 00:32:44,880
I'll keep a low profile.

598
00:32:51,680 --> 00:32:52,559
I booked it online in advance.

599
00:32:53,640 --> 00:32:54,319
Okay.

600
00:32:54,720 --> 00:32:55,440
ID, please.

601
00:32:55,519 --> 00:32:56,079
Let me take a look. Okay.

602
00:33:05,039 --> 00:33:06,079
Ms. Song.

603
00:33:06,400 --> 00:33:07,359
Welcome to

604
00:33:07,680 --> 00:33:09,000
China.

605
00:33:12,640 --> 00:33:13,440
Ms. Song.

606
00:33:14,359 --> 00:33:15,319
Welcome back.

607
00:33:15,599 --> 00:33:16,599
Mr. Cheng.

608
00:33:17,359 --> 00:33:18,640
Doing this

609
00:33:19,000 --> 00:33:20,440
puts me in an awkward position.

610
00:33:22,640 --> 00:33:23,920
You don't like roses, huh?

611
00:33:24,000 --> 00:33:24,920
I'll skip them next time.

612
00:33:25,319 --> 00:33:26,119
I was wondering

613
00:33:26,680 --> 00:33:27,880
if I could invite you

614
00:33:28,200 --> 00:33:29,160
to lunch.

615
00:33:29,440 --> 00:33:30,240
Sorry,

616
00:33:30,319 --> 00:33:31,240
I already have plans.

617
00:33:33,039 --> 00:33:33,839
Ms. Song.

618
00:33:34,559 --> 00:33:35,119
Are you

619
00:33:35,119 --> 00:33:36,880
really not giving me a chance?

620
00:33:38,160 --> 00:33:38,960
President Yan,

621
00:33:39,359 --> 00:33:41,839
I made it clear before coming back.

622
00:33:42,279 --> 00:33:43,640
My heart already belongs to someone.

623
00:33:43,839 --> 00:33:45,640
I don't want any further involvement with you.

624
00:33:45,960 --> 00:33:46,759
No,

625
00:33:46,759 --> 00:33:48,400
it used to belong to someone.

626
00:33:48,400 --> 00:33:50,000
But I'm pretty great too!

627
00:33:50,039 --> 00:33:51,680
If you just give me a chance

628
00:33:51,839 --> 00:33:53,279
and take the time to know me,

629
00:33:53,440 --> 00:33:54,640
you'll definitely give your heart

630
00:33:54,839 --> 00:33:56,279
to me instead.

631
00:34:01,599 --> 00:34:02,200
Ms. Song.

632
00:34:02,319 --> 00:34:02,880
I'm He Li.

633
00:34:03,200 --> 00:34:04,480
President An sent me to pick you up.

634
00:34:05,039 --> 00:34:07,039
I was wondering who swooped in on me.

635
00:34:07,319 --> 00:34:08,920
That kid Cheng An didn't come himself?

636
00:34:09,039 --> 00:34:10,280
He just sent a lapdog.

637
00:34:11,320 --> 00:34:12,320
President Yan.

638
00:34:12,840 --> 00:34:14,039
Look who it is.

639
00:34:14,679 --> 00:34:17,039
Which young lady are you chasing today?

640
00:34:18,199 --> 00:34:19,079
Watch your mouth.

641
00:34:19,360 --> 00:34:20,039
I heard...

642
00:34:20,039 --> 00:34:21,559
...the guy who prints your banners...

643
00:34:21,559 --> 00:34:22,840
...drives a Mercedes now.

644
00:34:23,039 --> 00:34:24,239
I should open a print shop someday.

645
00:34:24,280 --> 00:34:26,039
You could give me some business too.

646
00:34:26,039 --> 00:34:26,800
He Li.

647
00:34:26,880 --> 00:34:28,039
That's enough out of you.

648
00:34:28,880 --> 00:34:31,000
If you two really start fighting here...

649
00:34:31,239 --> 00:34:33,239
...I won't be able to face Auntie Cheng.

650
00:34:34,679 --> 00:34:36,039
I'll let it slide for Ms. Song's sake.

651
00:34:36,840 --> 00:34:37,800
I just got back to the country.

652
00:34:38,079 --> 00:34:39,800
It's only right I go visit Auntie Cheng.

653
00:34:40,039 --> 00:34:41,480
Could you give me a ride?

654
00:34:43,199 --> 00:34:43,880
Ms. Song...

655
00:34:43,880 --> 00:34:44,039
I...

656
00:34:44,039 --> 00:34:44,239
I...

657
00:34:44,239 --> 00:34:45,400
My car is right nearby.

658
00:34:45,400 --> 00:34:45,840
Back off.

659
00:34:45,840 --> 00:34:46,679
Go get the car.

660
00:34:47,239 --> 00:34:47,960
Song...

661
00:34:47,960 --> 00:34:48,800
Ms. Song.

662
00:34:48,800 --> 00:34:49,599
Let me drive you.

663
00:34:50,280 --> 00:34:50,800
Wait.

664
00:34:51,159 --> 00:34:51,840
Ms. Song.

665
00:34:51,840 --> 00:34:52,639
Let me drive you back.

666
00:34:52,639 --> 00:34:54,039
My car isn't far from here.

667
00:34:58,639 --> 00:35:00,960
That's what you get for parking so far.

668
00:35:03,199 --> 00:35:04,480
It's been twenty years.

669
00:35:04,639 --> 00:35:06,639
You've grown into such a beauty.

670
00:35:08,000 --> 00:35:09,079
So thoughtful of you.

671
00:35:09,079 --> 00:35:11,280
Coming to see me right after getting back.

672
00:35:12,119 --> 00:35:13,760
Just for your thoughtfulness...

673
00:35:13,800 --> 00:35:15,039
...this time, Valley Breeze Group...

674
00:35:15,199 --> 00:35:16,639
...will definitely work with Anxin Group...

675
00:35:16,639 --> 00:35:18,159
...for a proper collaboration.

676
00:35:19,559 --> 00:35:20,559
I've long heard that President An...

677
00:35:20,599 --> 00:35:22,400
...has been running Valley Breeze Group brilliantly.

678
00:35:23,440 --> 00:35:24,360
Returning this time...

679
00:35:24,360 --> 00:35:25,719
...I was planning to collaborate with him.

680
00:35:27,280 --> 00:35:28,000
Yes.

681
00:35:28,000 --> 00:35:29,760
Cheng An is great.

682
00:35:30,199 --> 00:35:31,039
It's just that...

683
00:35:32,920 --> 00:35:34,639
...he lacks a bit of maturity.

684
00:35:35,360 --> 00:35:37,679
Look at him paying respects to his father the other day.

685
00:35:37,800 --> 00:35:40,000
He actually bruised himself up this badly.

686
00:35:43,000 --> 00:35:44,239
Speaking of the Cheng family...

687
00:35:44,400 --> 00:35:45,480
...this son of mine...

688
00:35:45,599 --> 00:35:46,679
...Cheng Yan...

689
00:35:46,679 --> 00:35:49,039
...is a very steady man.

690
00:35:49,440 --> 00:35:50,440
All these years...

691
00:35:50,519 --> 00:35:52,480
...with all the major moves Valley Breeze Group made...

692
00:35:52,679 --> 00:35:53,400
...which one of them...

693
00:35:53,559 --> 00:35:55,599
...wasn't pushed forward by him behind the scenes?

694
00:35:58,440 --> 00:35:59,239
Third Brother.

695
00:35:59,880 --> 00:36:01,960
Ms. Song returned today...

696
00:36:02,960 --> 00:36:04,320
...and you didn't even pick her up yourself.

697
00:36:05,519 --> 00:36:06,960
Now you're pulling a long face.

698
00:36:07,199 --> 00:36:09,039
Who are you giving that attitude to?

699
00:36:09,360 --> 00:36:10,440
You're absolutely right, brother.

700
00:36:14,159 --> 00:36:16,239
That wound on your lip doesn't look like a bruise.

701
00:36:19,000 --> 00:36:20,400
Looks like someone hit you.

702
00:36:21,159 --> 00:36:21,800
Brother.

703
00:36:21,880 --> 00:36:23,280
Tell me who hit you.

704
00:36:23,519 --> 00:36:24,840
You have to look at the master before hitting a dog.

705
00:36:25,039 --> 00:36:25,960
I'll avenge you.

706
00:36:26,079 --> 00:36:27,079
Don't get so worked up.

707
00:36:27,440 --> 00:36:28,239
Go sit back down first.

708
00:36:28,320 --> 00:36:29,400
Don't hide it.

709
00:36:30,039 --> 00:36:32,000
Ms. Song is an old friend of our family.

710
00:36:32,280 --> 00:36:33,039
And in the future...

711
00:36:33,039 --> 00:36:34,519
...we might even become family.

712
00:36:34,519 --> 00:36:35,079
Right?

713
00:36:35,079 --> 00:36:36,119
Speaking of old friends...

714
00:36:36,360 --> 00:36:37,760
...my old friends in the Cheng family...

715
00:36:37,760 --> 00:36:39,119
...aren't limited to President An.

716
00:36:40,119 --> 00:36:40,880
Sang Luo.

717
00:36:47,159 --> 00:36:48,159
It's been a few years.

718
00:36:48,480 --> 00:36:49,760
I could barely recognize you.
